   "title": "A thousand years of war",
   "date": "2000 BBY · one thousand years before Ruusan",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "The Jedi Master Phanius walks out of the Order with fifty followers and takes the name Darth Ruin. On the old Sith worlds of the Stygian Caldera his New Sith raise an order the Republic believes it buried a millennium earlier. The New Sith Wars have begun; they will not end for a thousand years.",
